{"name":"Diantha","hex":"#fcf6dc","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Pokémon X and Y","blocks":[{"text":"Pokémon X and Pokémon Y are 2013 role-playing video games developed by Game Freak and published by The Pokémon Company and Nintendo for the Nintendo 3DS. They are the first installments in the sixth generation of the main Pokémon game series. First announced in January 2013 by Nintendo president Satoru Iwata through a Nintendo Direct, Pokémon X and Pokémon Y were released worldwide in October 2013, and they were the first Pokémon games to have a simultaneous global release."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/dc/Pokemon_X_and_Y_box_art.jpg/330px-Pokemon_X_and_Y_box_art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pok%C3%A9mon_X_and_Y"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/67/Pokemon_Kalos_Region.png/330px-Pokemon_Kalos_Region.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/67/Pokemon_Kalos_Region.png/330px-Pokemon_Kalos_Region.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APokemon_Kalos_Region.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/600x600_GMT_France_topo-R1.jpg/500px-600x600_GMT_France_topo-R1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/600x600_GMT_France_topo-R1.jpg/500px-600x600_GMT_France_topo-R1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A600x600_GMT_France_topo-R1.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Seine_and_Eiffel_Tower_from_Tour_Saint_Jacques_2013-08.JPG/500px-Seine_and_Eiffel_Towe